Delivery on this item is usually within 7-10 Workings Days. Should you require it sooner please do get in touch and we will always do our best to help!

This tree is sold in a stabiliser base which gives the tree stability to stand. This is not meant for display use. The stabiliser pot will fit into the display pot of your choice! Why note choose one from our range and use our potting service! If you have your own display pot simply put the tree into the display pot and cover the stabiliser base with sand, pebbles or decorative stones!

Potting Service – Choose one of our display planters and for an additional small charge we can secure the tree into the base of your choice ready to display on delivery. For external products we can make the planter heavy but this will incur a heavy load delivery charge starting from £25.

Should you require it we have an in house team boasting over 12 years of experience in the manufacture and installation of artificial flora. Please do get in touch if you require a bespoke item or would like a cost on our installation team.

